[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（摩美々にとって、今までで最も大きな規模の\r\nファッションショー、そしてミニライブ……）",
    "charCategory": "stand_costume",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "005",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00007",
    "bgm": "008"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（そろそろ始まるが……\r\nなんだかプロデューサーの俺が緊張してきたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "摩美々、もうすぐ本番だけど\r\n大丈夫か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050010,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "えー、なにがですかぁ？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、いつも通りだな\r\n緊張してるんじゃないかと思っていたが",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050020,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "まぁ、リハも大丈夫でしたからねー",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "リハがうまくいったからといって、本番前に\r\n落ち着いていられるとは限らない。摩美々はさすがだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050030,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……こーんなに余裕を持ててるのはぁ、誰かさんに、\r\nレッスンしろしろ言われ続けたからかも、しれませんねー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ。日々のレッスンは、\r\n思いがけないところで役に立つだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050040,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "今回はぁ、役に立ったと思いますケドー",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "役に立たないはずがないさ。摩美々がアイドルとして\r\n輝くため、必要なことを選んできたつもりだからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050050,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そうですねー。アイドルになってからの私は、\r\nらしくないこといっぱいしてきましたぁ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050060,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "笑顔も、レッスンも、握手会も、\r\nアイドルらしくて、私らしくなかったはずなのに……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050070,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "今じゃすっかり、\r\n私になくてはならないものになっちゃいました",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050080,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "これも、誰かさんのおかげですかねー……？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……摩美々",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050090,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "べっ、別にー、感謝したわけじゃないですからぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050100,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "プロデューサーがあんまり厳しいからぁ\r\n無理やり変えられちゃっただけですよー",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、まんざらでもないって顔だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050110,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そうですねー\r\nアイドルになる前よりは、退屈してないかもしれませんー",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050120,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……まぁ、私の実力が高いからぁ\r\nプロデューサーの要望にこたえられただけですけどー",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ、それもそうだな\r\nこれからも期待してるぞっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050130,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……プロデューサー\r\nこんな悪い子に期待し続けてくれて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050140,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "あ…………ぅ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん、どうした？\r\n言いづらいことか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050150,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "な、なんでもありませんよー",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050160,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "あー、もーすぐ本番ですねー\r\nなんだかぁ、急に緊張してきちゃった気がしますー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050170,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "プロデューサー、こんな私に、いつもみたいに\r\n何か言っておきたいこととかありますー？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "今日の摩美々は最高だ！",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "思いっきり楽しめ！",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "select": "すべて出し切ってこい！",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050180,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "えー、大げさじゃないですかぁ？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当のことだぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050190,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そうなんですかぁ……不思議ですねー、\r\n褒められるのってあんまり好きじゃないんですケドー",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050200,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "プロデューサーに褒められると、\r\n悪い気しないんですよねー",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050210,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "こんなふうに思うってことはぁ、\r\nプロデューサーがヘンな人ってことですかねー？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は普通に褒めただけだから\r\n変ではないと思うんだが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "褒められるのが好きじゃないって、\r\n摩美々こそ変わってないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050220,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そうかもしれないですねー",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さ、そうこうしているうちに、\r\n本番が始まるみたいだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050230,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "ふふー、私はいつも通りにやってきますねー",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050240,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "それがプロデューサーの求めていること……ですよね？",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もちろんだ\r\n行ってこい！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050250,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "えー、そういうのってー、\r\n私っぽくないと思いませんかぁ？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "摩美々なりに、楽しかったと思える\r\nライブになればいいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに、こんな大きなステージ、\r\nきっと楽しめるぞ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050260,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……本当に楽しめるんですかぁ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろんだ！　それに、摩美々がステージに立つことで、\r\n幸せな気持ちになれるファンがたくさん集まってる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "摩美々はたくさんの人を幸せにできるんだ\r\nそれはきっと楽しさに繋がると思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050270,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……人を幸せにする楽しさ、ですかぁ\r\nそれは、私も少し気になる世界ですケド",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なら、その世界が見える景色を、\r\nステージの上からしっかり目に焼き付けてこい！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050280,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……まぁ、そこまで言うならー\r\n眺めてきまぁす",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、いっぱい楽しんでくるんだぞ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これがアイドル・摩美々の伝説のステージになるくらい\r\n全力でやってくるんだ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050290,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "えー、プロデューサー\r\n今日も熱すぎますよー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "熱くもなるだろ！\r\n今日まで、摩美々がどれだけ頑張ったか見てきたんだからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その成果を、ファンのみんなにも知ってもらいたいだろ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050300,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そうですかねー……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050300"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050310,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "まぁ、ほどほどに頑張ってみますねー\r\nでも、期待しないでくださいよー？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうは言っても、ステージでは本気をだすんだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001050320,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "ふふー。それは見てのお楽しみ、ですかねー\r\nじゃあ、行ってきますねー",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500105/1005001050320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、行ってこい！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（摩美々なら、全力でやってくれるはずだ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]